      "message": "`GetBlkSseSum` (here), `CalcVarianceStat` (line 276), and `HighbdCalcVarianceStat` (line 362) only guard `bw \u003c kLanes`/`kCols` (`32`), so any `bw \u003e 32` not divisible by `32` (e.g., `bw \u003d 48`) reads out of bounds on the last vector load—and `*CalcVarianceStat` clamps the right border at `x + 31` instead of `bw - 1`. In addition, `bh \u003c\u003d 0` in `*CalcVarianceStat` still reads row `0`. Please fall back to `_c` (for `bw % kLanes !\u003d 0` / `bh \u003c\u003d 0`) or assert these preconditions.",
